    <summary>Source code of OpenProject, the open source project management software. Does not install a runnable server: use Docker to run OpenProject on Windows.</summary>
    <description><![CDATA[OpenProject is open source project management software: efficient classic, agile or hybrid project management in a secure environment.

## What this package installs

**This package contains the source code of OpenProject** (the source archive of each GitHub release), extracted to `%ChocolateyInstall%\lib\openproject\tools`.
It does **not** install a runnable OpenProject server: there is no executable, no Windows service and no web server.

OpenProject does not support Windows natively. To run it on Windows, use the official Docker image (Docker Desktop with the WSL2 backend):
see the [Docker installation guide](https://www.openproject.org/docs/installation-and-operations/installation/docker/).
]]></description>
